WEBVTT

00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:05.950
Once upon a time...

00:00:06.870 --> 00:00:09.980
There was a beautiful girl named Cinderella.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:16.040
Her mean stepmother and stepsisters 
were very cruel to her.

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:19.990
Then one day, a grand ball 
was held at the palace.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:24.240
Her stepmother and sisters 
went in their best finery,

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:28.290
but Cinderella had not even a dress to wear.

00:00:28.710 --> 00:00:32.320
That is, until her Fairy Godmother appeared

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:33.850
and cast a magic spell on her.

00:00:34.540 --> 00:00:38.600
Cinderella found herself wearing
 a stunning dress and glass slippers.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:43.300
She then rode a pumpkin carriage to the ball,

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:49.380
where she had her fated meeting with the prince.

00:00:50.060 --> 00:00:51.320
Over there!

00:02:33.040 --> 00:02:36.510
Ex's Journey Begins

00:02:38.580 --> 00:02:39.720
Stop him!

00:02:39.960 --> 00:02:41.180
You heard her, kid.

00:02:46.270 --> 00:02:48.390
Surrender now.

00:02:48.550 --> 00:02:51.140
Thank goodness, Tao! Shane!

00:02:51.140 --> 00:02:52.880
That was careless of you, boss.

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:54.860
Get lost again, did you?

00:02:55.120 --> 00:02:56.570
What do you mean "again"?!

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:59.210
Anyway, who's the kid?

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:00.320
I'll explain.

00:03:00.750 --> 00:03:02.330
I'll explain to you too, Ex.

00:03:02.330 --> 00:03:02.890
But...

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:05.800
You can't do anything sneaking 
into the castle on your own.

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:07.570
It's probably too late...

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:13.210
Well, if this is my fate, then so be it.

00:03:27.630 --> 00:03:30.020
This ain't good.

00:03:30.180 --> 00:03:33.080
The Chaos Teller's influence is expanding.

00:03:33.080 --> 00:03:36.860
Most of the people have already 
been turned into villains, I bet.

00:03:37.230 --> 00:03:39.720
Villains are those monsters, right?

00:03:39.720 --> 00:03:41.330
Good thing you didn't go alone, kid.

00:03:41.330 --> 00:03:45.160
You would've been surrounded in an instant.

00:03:45.760 --> 00:03:50.160
But I still have to save Cinderella!

00:03:51.450 --> 00:03:53.900
If you want to save her that badly,

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:55.630
she must be your girlfriend, right?

00:03:55.630 --> 00:03:57.710
I-It's not like that!

00:03:58.280 --> 00:04:03.340
I just promised her I'd help 
make her fate come true...

00:04:03.770 --> 00:04:05.420
Yeah right.

00:04:05.420 --> 00:04:08.680
You were planning on eloping 
with her, weren't you?

00:04:08.970 --> 00:04:10.050
No way!

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:11.810
You can't change what's in a Book of Fate!

00:04:11.810 --> 00:04:15.180
You can... if yours is blank.

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:16.190
Really?

00:04:16.660 --> 00:04:21.900
But your friend Cinderella will cease 
to be the main character of her story.

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:25.780
She may end up suffering
 more than she has already.

00:04:26.190 --> 00:04:27.950
Would you be okay with that?

00:04:30.530 --> 00:04:31.540
I...

00:04:34.740 --> 00:04:38.230
In any event, there's no point in staying here.

00:04:38.230 --> 00:04:41.300
We need to find the Chaos Teller 
responsible for all this.

00:04:41.560 --> 00:04:43.130
What's a Chaos Teller?

00:04:43.130 --> 00:04:46.640
Somebody who changes people's 
Books of Fate and turns them into villains,

00:04:46.640 --> 00:04:49.010
or just uses their incredible 
strength to do harm.

00:04:49.010 --> 00:04:50.850
Basically the boss o' the baddies.

00:04:51.010 --> 00:04:57.020
Of course, people with blank books 
like us aren't affected by their power.

00:04:57.300 --> 00:04:59.270
Then you guys also...

00:04:59.880 --> 00:05:01.320
You finally figured it out, huh?

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:02.030
Yeah.

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:07.160
There's nothing left to fear.

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.760
The stepmother and stepsisters 
who were so cruel to you

00:05:10.760 --> 00:05:13.790
have become my slaves.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:18.330
And you won't have to suffer 
anymore because of your fate.

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:22.180
When the time comes, I cast a spell
 on the girl fated to be Cinderella

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:24.560
and turn her into a princess.

00:05:24.560 --> 00:05:26.510
That was my role.

00:05:27.030 --> 00:05:30.000
But over the years,

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:33.430
many a Cinderella has still been unhappy,
 even after becoming queen.

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:37.900
If my magic is just making 
things worse for them,

00:05:38.120 --> 00:05:42.150
then this time, I will protect 
Cinderella from all sorrow.

00:05:42.370 --> 00:05:44.570
<i>That</i> is my role!

00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:47.110
Splendid...

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:49.280
Such splendid love.

00:05:49.580 --> 00:05:53.830
I will allow no one to interrupt 
my Cinderella's sleep. No one.

00:05:59.040 --> 00:06:01.840
The villains are gathering at the castle.

00:06:02.040 --> 00:06:04.510
The Chaos Teller is probably there too.

00:06:04.510 --> 00:06:07.260
We need to handle things 
before they all group up.

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:09.870
Let's make this quick!

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:10.710
Wait!

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:12.620
Take me, too.

00:06:12.620 --> 00:06:15.130
It's too dangerous for an amateur.

00:06:15.130 --> 00:06:17.480
But I still have to go!

00:06:17.480 --> 00:06:18.860
Goodness gracious...

00:06:18.860 --> 00:06:20.060
What do we do, missy?

00:06:20.340 --> 00:06:23.010
I can vouch for his abilities.

00:06:23.010 --> 00:06:26.430
He did a great job defeating 
the villain we just encountered.

00:06:26.430 --> 00:06:28.530
Well, if you say so, boss.

00:06:28.750 --> 00:06:30.490
Then it's settled.

00:06:30.490 --> 00:06:32.030
Let's do this, missy.

00:06:34.810 --> 00:06:36.250
The Walled Garden Kingdom, right?

00:06:36.550 --> 00:06:38.070
A floating book?!

00:06:38.070 --> 00:06:39.830
This is the Walled Garden Kingdom.

00:06:39.830 --> 00:06:41.190
Walled Garden...?

00:06:41.190 --> 00:06:46.260
A magic book you need to "tune" the world.

00:06:51.750 --> 00:06:53.540
A mirror came out of the book?!

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:54.140
How?!

00:06:54.430 --> 00:06:57.160
You sure ask a lot of questions, huh?

00:06:57.160 --> 00:06:57.940
Sorry...

00:06:57.940 --> 00:07:01.400
Ex, show me the bookmark 
I gave you in the forest.

00:07:02.080 --> 00:07:02.900
This?

00:07:03.350 --> 00:07:04.650
A wild crest?!

00:07:05.590 --> 00:07:07.410
Seriously?!

00:07:08.610 --> 00:07:10.290
That's a surprise!

00:07:10.290 --> 00:07:13.240
Is this little picture that amazing?

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:18.160
Normally, the crest you have limits the
 type of heroes you can connect with.

00:07:18.590 --> 00:07:22.710
But a wild crest can connect with any hero.

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:25.340
It's kind of a jack of all trades,
 master of none.

00:07:25.340 --> 00:07:26.800
Master of none?

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:29.210
Anyway, stand in front of the mirror.

00:07:29.400 --> 00:07:30.230
Like this?

00:07:31.250 --> 00:07:35.480
This magic mirror is the bond 
that connects us and the heroes.

00:07:35.480 --> 00:07:39.390
It will summon a new hero 
from the soul of whoever looks into it.

00:07:45.350 --> 00:07:46.840
Oh, that's Alice!

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:47.440
Who's that?

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:51.240
You've never heard of
 Alice in Wonderland?!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:53.280
Every girl dreams of being Alice!

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:56.650
The way her cute appearance contrasts with 
the strange and dark world around her...

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:57.420
Forget her. Just hold your
 bookmark up to the mirror.

00:07:56.650 --> 00:07:58.480
That's what they call gap moe!

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.740
Now you can connect with Alice.

00:08:06.530 --> 00:08:08.220
But Alice is a girl!

00:08:08.220 --> 00:08:10.430
Am I going to transform into <i>her</i>?

00:08:10.430 --> 00:08:11.320
What?

00:08:11.320 --> 00:08:13.140
What's wrong with Alice?

00:08:13.140 --> 00:08:15.140
She's <i>the</i> Alice!

00:08:15.290 --> 00:08:18.310
We don't have time for this.

00:08:18.670 --> 00:08:22.100
We're all set. Tao family, roll out!

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:26.020
I never said you could 
call us the Tao family!

00:08:26.020 --> 00:08:28.800
Tao family, to the castle we go!

00:08:28.800 --> 00:08:30.440
I know you heard me!

00:08:37.030 --> 00:08:38.910
Let's get to work.

00:08:39.120 --> 00:08:43.790
Villains are weak to 
people with blank books.

00:08:44.310 --> 00:08:47.570
Okay, follow my lead.

00:08:47.570 --> 00:08:49.400
Did you have a plan?

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:50.720
I just came up with one!

00:08:51.810 --> 00:08:53.720
I'll bite, I guess.

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:55.380
What's the plan?

00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:59.680
Cut a path through to the castle!

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:02.060
I figured as much.

00:09:02.060 --> 00:09:05.780
I'd love to vote no, but...

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:08.900
We're out of time!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.320
All right!

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.560
You too, Ex!

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:15.700
Okay!

00:09:16.090 --> 00:09:20.220
Tao family! Into battle we go!

00:09:31.000 --> 00:09:32.960
Rosen Drei Spear!

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:41.850
That takes care of them.

00:09:42.130 --> 00:09:43.960
No other enemies sighted.

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:45.830
We got 'em!

00:09:51.710 --> 00:09:53.620
Not bad.

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:56.020
Looks like you've trained hard.

00:09:56.020 --> 00:09:56.740
But...

00:09:59.710 --> 00:10:01.380
This is okay, right?

00:10:01.380 --> 00:10:02.610
No worries.

00:10:02.610 --> 00:10:05.440
Everything will go back to normal 
once Reina does her tuning.

00:10:05.440 --> 00:10:06.830
Is that what you meant earlier?

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:07.690
Indeed.

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:12.940
I can take a story that a Chaos Teller has twisted

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:15.380
and restore the Story Zone to normal.

00:10:15.380 --> 00:10:16.420
That's what we call "tuning."

00:10:16.720 --> 00:10:18.460
Does it turn back time?

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:20.180
Not quite.

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:22.660
Anyone who doesn't have 
a blank book will forget

00:10:22.660 --> 00:10:25.630
everything that happened 
after the Chaos Teller appeared,

00:10:25.630 --> 00:10:29.850
and basically pick up where they left off.

00:10:31.260 --> 00:10:33.320
She's a little bit of an airhead,

00:10:33.320 --> 00:10:36.900
but only the Priestess of Tuning
 can use that power.

00:10:36.900 --> 00:10:38.620
What was that about being an airhead?

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:41.580
Of course, we need to smack the 
Chaos Teller around a bit first

00:10:41.580 --> 00:10:45.080
to weaken it before
 we can do any of that.

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:48.080
Then we need to get to the 
castle as soon as possible!

00:10:52.320 --> 00:10:53.110
Cinderella!

00:10:53.110 --> 00:10:54.210
Hey, you can't just...

00:10:57.390 --> 00:10:59.560
What did I just say?

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:01.720
Looks like an ambush.

00:11:03.720 --> 00:11:06.450
Missy, we'll handle these guys.

00:11:06.450 --> 00:11:07.470
You go after the kid.

00:11:07.470 --> 00:11:08.230
Got it!

00:11:11.190 --> 00:11:12.420
<i>Please be safe!</i>

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:13.350
Wait!

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:18.900
If the Chaos Teller is there, you won't 
be able to do anything by yourself.

00:11:19.260 --> 00:11:22.370
It's too strong.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:24.030
Many a time, we've only barely survived—

00:11:24.030 --> 00:11:25.740
I've been waiting for you.

00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:28.950
You took much longer than expected.

00:11:28.950 --> 00:11:30.140
You're...

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:31.330
I know you...

00:11:31.330 --> 00:11:32.480
You do?

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.420
He's a minstrel I met in 
the market this afternoon.

00:11:35.570 --> 00:11:37.450
I see, I see.

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:40.480
So you've sided with
 the Priestess of Tuning.

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:42.180
This is interesting!

00:11:42.190 --> 00:11:46.890
It's your fault a Chaos Teller appeared
 in this Story Zone, isn't it, Loki?

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:49.790
Ah, Chaos Tellers...

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:52.440
What beautiful creatures!

00:11:53.450 --> 00:11:58.540
They free those who are bound
 by the threads of fate

00:11:58.540 --> 00:12:00.200
woven by the Storyteller.

00:12:00.200 --> 00:12:01.490
You could even call them...

00:12:01.680 --> 00:12:03.320
Hope!

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:06.490
No! The Chaos Tellers are just chaos!

00:12:06.590 --> 00:12:12.530
And that chaos will liberate worlds 
doomed to repeat fate over and over!

00:12:13.840 --> 00:12:17.380
It's wonderful... Truly wonderful!

00:12:17.550 --> 00:12:21.130
What's wonderful about making 
so many people suffer?!

00:12:21.690 --> 00:12:23.210
Reina, who is this man?

00:12:23.210 --> 00:12:25.890
The one who creates Chaos Tellers.

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:27.100
And my...

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:27.510
Missy!

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:32.520
Oh, my. I see your friends 
have arrived, as well.

00:12:33.580 --> 00:12:34.390
Him...

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:37.930
It's been a while since 
I've seen that nasty grin.

00:12:37.930 --> 00:12:39.360
How frightening.

00:12:39.630 --> 00:12:43.040
I don't think I can beat you four-on-one.

00:12:43.040 --> 00:12:46.360
But I'm just here to say hello tonight...

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:48.910
and invite you to the ball.

00:12:48.910 --> 00:12:49.910
Wait!

00:12:50.140 --> 00:12:53.960
The ball awaits beyond this door.

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:58.170
He's always so quick to run.

00:12:58.980 --> 00:12:59.920
Reina?

00:13:00.530 --> 00:13:05.130
I can sense a Chaos Teller
behind that door.

00:13:10.160 --> 00:13:13.940
This is no ball. It's a villain party.

00:13:13.940 --> 00:13:15.340
There are so many...

00:13:15.340 --> 00:13:18.230
So all the guests were turned into villains?

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:23.630
Cinderella!

00:13:23.630 --> 00:13:26.160
Looks like she hasn't become a villain yet.

00:13:26.160 --> 00:13:26.780
Just wait for me!

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:30.380
Oh, look! A new guest.

00:13:31.720 --> 00:13:32.450
Who are you?

00:13:32.990 --> 00:13:36.220
One who grants wishes.

00:13:36.220 --> 00:13:41.000
I can give you a pretty dress, 
glass slippers, or even a pumpkin carriage!

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:42.880
The Fairy Godmother?

00:13:43.030 --> 00:13:45.990
But the pretty dress and glass slippers

00:13:45.990 --> 00:13:50.580
won't guarantee Cinderella true happiness.

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:57.060
So I decided that I would bring her 
here and protect her forever.

00:13:57.290 --> 00:13:58.990
She can't be...

00:13:59.970 --> 00:14:04.000
Everyone who made her suffer is now my slave.

00:14:04.000 --> 00:14:08.310
She'll spend eternity here 
with me watching over her.

00:14:08.310 --> 00:14:11.280
That is what will bring her true happiness.

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:12.380
No!

00:14:12.380 --> 00:14:16.250
Cinderella was always waiting 
for the day her life would change!

00:14:18.540 --> 00:14:20.580
You still don't understand?

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:26.460
I've watched dozens upon dozens 
of Cinderellas over the ages!

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:28.260
This is... This is what's best!

00:14:28.630 --> 00:14:31.990
She can spend eternity within my dream...

00:14:31.990 --> 00:14:34.360
This is true happiness...

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:36.960
...for Cinderella!

00:14:37.440 --> 00:14:39.900
It finally revealed itself!

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:40.780
That's...

00:14:40.780 --> 00:14:42.860
Yes, that's the Chaos Teller!

00:14:43.200 --> 00:14:47.460
It resonated with the Fairy Godmother's 
suffering and possessed her!

00:14:50.980 --> 00:14:54.910
I guess we could call it a Chaos Godmother.

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:58.750
Anyone who stands in the way 
of her happiness is an enemy!

00:14:58.960 --> 00:15:00.870
And I will defeat all enemies!

00:15:01.140 --> 00:15:06.170
My slaves! Protect my beloved Cinderella!

00:15:08.200 --> 00:15:09.280
Is everyone ready?

00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:11.130
You betcha! Anytime!

00:15:11.130 --> 00:15:12.550
Same here.

00:15:12.860 --> 00:15:14.140
<i>Just wait, Cinderella...</i>

00:15:14.610 --> 00:15:19.640
<i>This is something only a role-less boy 
like me with a blank Book of Fate can do!</i>

00:15:19.860 --> 00:15:22.560
I'm going to end this nightmare!

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:23.910
White Rabbit!

00:15:23.910 --> 00:15:24.840
La Belle!

00:15:24.840 --> 00:15:25.870
Robin Hood!

00:15:26.150 --> 00:15:26.920
Alice!

00:15:27.530 --> 00:15:28.650
Connect!

00:15:38.200 --> 00:15:41.900
Is it time for another adventure
 in Wonderland?

00:15:44.160 --> 00:15:45.210
Here I go!

00:15:45.480 --> 00:15:49.050
You terrifying creatures! 
Threats to Cinderella's happiness!

00:15:49.050 --> 00:15:51.630
Disappear, all of you!

00:15:53.390 --> 00:15:54.600
Here she comes!

00:15:55.410 --> 00:15:56.510
I won't lose!

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:58.430
There's nothing my arrows can't pierce!

00:16:00.130 --> 00:16:02.310
Out of the way!

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:07.400
Where'd Ex go?

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:08.940
Cinderella!

00:16:10.390 --> 00:16:11.950
You're a bad girl!

00:16:12.670 --> 00:16:15.240
You're the bad girl!

00:16:17.080 --> 00:16:20.910
Anyone who threatens Cinderella's 
happiness is my enemy!

00:16:21.410 --> 00:16:24.430
And I will shatter all enemies!

00:16:24.430 --> 00:16:28.250
I'll tear you limb from limb!

00:16:28.490 --> 00:16:31.190
So this is the power of a Chaos Teller?

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:34.530
What are you doing?

00:16:35.180 --> 00:16:37.520
Shane, can you back her 
up from where you are?

00:16:37.520 --> 00:16:39.470
No! There are too many of them!

00:16:39.470 --> 00:16:41.700
Now disappear!

00:16:41.700 --> 00:16:45.930
Leave not a drop of blood
 nor shard of bone behind!

00:16:58.150 --> 00:16:59.950
Cinderella...

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:07.790
Hurry, hurry! Don't be late!

00:17:10.160 --> 00:17:11.300
My power...

00:17:11.630 --> 00:17:12.800
Now!

00:17:15.580 --> 00:17:18.720
I will protect Cinderella's dreams!

00:17:18.720 --> 00:17:22.060
Dreams? No, this is a nightmare!

00:17:24.590 --> 00:17:27.770
This isn't the real dream 
Cinderella should be having!

00:17:29.430 --> 00:17:32.820
Wonder Labyrinth!

00:17:40.080 --> 00:17:41.830
Yes!

00:17:42.430 --> 00:17:45.020
I just wanted her...

00:17:46.980 --> 00:17:51.050
to really be happy...

00:17:56.970 --> 00:17:59.310
Cinderella! Cinderella!

00:18:02.190 --> 00:18:03.380
Are you awake?

00:18:03.380 --> 00:18:04.580
Ex...

00:18:04.580 --> 00:18:05.860
Is that you?

00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:06.560
Yeah.

00:18:07.080 --> 00:18:09.880
I had the scariest dream...

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:14.440
I went to the ball and there 
were all these terrible monsters...

00:18:14.710 --> 00:18:17.540
It's okay. It's okay now, Cinderella.

00:18:17.540 --> 00:18:19.320
The nightmare is over.

00:18:20.570 --> 00:18:21.970
I'm so glad...

00:18:23.060 --> 00:18:25.540
Where's the prince? Is he safe?

00:18:25.890 --> 00:18:27.160
Of course he is.

00:18:27.320 --> 00:18:29.140
Everything will go back to normal soon.

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:32.530
And your life will change, 
just like your Book of Fate says.

00:18:34.040 --> 00:18:36.420
It's all thanks to you.

00:18:36.680 --> 00:18:40.010
Hardly. It's because you tried 
so hard and hung in there.

00:18:40.560 --> 00:18:45.340
Only because you were 
always there to smile at me.

00:18:45.340 --> 00:18:47.210
That's how I was able to do it.

00:18:48.550 --> 00:18:49.850
Thank you...

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:52.390
Ex...

00:18:54.320 --> 00:18:55.830
I'm going to begin the tuning.

00:18:58.870 --> 00:19:03.830
Everyone will forget what's happened 
since the story started to fall apart.

00:19:03.830 --> 00:19:06.540
She won't remember that you 
saved her from this nightmare.

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:08.070
That's for the best.

00:19:08.070 --> 00:19:10.210
I want all these memories gone...

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:11.790
Are you sure?

00:19:12.400 --> 00:19:17.130
She's going to have a happy ending, 
just like her Book of Fate says.

00:19:17.130 --> 00:19:20.840
I wanted to protect that. 
I can't stand in her way.

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:24.050
Smart thinking.

00:19:24.450 --> 00:19:28.530
But if everyone forgets everything,
doesn't that include you guys fighting?

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:29.510
Sure does.

00:19:29.510 --> 00:19:32.060
Why do you fight when 
no one thanks you for it?

00:19:32.590 --> 00:19:35.930
It's hard to put into words, but...

00:19:36.880 --> 00:19:39.570
Because that's the role 
I decided for myself!

00:19:43.250 --> 00:19:45.190
Okay, I'm getting started.

00:19:50.400 --> 00:19:53.190
Teller of tales, 
drowned in a maelstrom of chaos...

00:19:53.680 --> 00:19:57.670
By my words, I now begin the tuning...

00:20:09.760 --> 00:20:13.420
<i>Thank you for giving a 
role to a role-less boy.</i>

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:26.980
Heya! Working hard?

00:20:26.980 --> 00:20:29.270
I'm taking it easy now 
that the wedding's over.

00:20:29.660 --> 00:20:30.790
Well, hang in there.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:31.870
You, too.

00:20:32.230 --> 00:20:37.170
So Cinderella married the prince 
and lived happily after ever, huh?

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:39.560
Well, what now?

00:20:39.560 --> 00:20:42.750
We keep following the cause 
of all this, like always.

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:43.780
Off we go, then.

00:20:43.780 --> 00:20:44.880
Hey, that's right!

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:47.950
Shouldn't we be talking to the kid?

00:20:47.950 --> 00:20:49.580
He's got a lot to learn,

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:51.310
but if I trained him...

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:56.010
He fought because he wanted 
to protect his childhood friend.

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:58.820
He has no reason to come with us.

00:20:59.230 --> 00:21:02.690
Then who's that boy carrying a 
pack and running towards us?

00:21:03.060 --> 00:21:04.360
Guys!

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:08.570
He's definitely not here to see us off.

00:21:08.750 --> 00:21:10.200
What'll we do, missy?

00:21:10.200 --> 00:21:11.590
Good question...

00:21:15.200 --> 00:21:16.990
I wanted to ask you all something!

00:21:16.990 --> 00:21:17.930
Sure.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:19.630
I didn't say anything yet!

00:21:19.880 --> 00:21:23.130
The more people we have 
on our side, the better!

00:21:23.920 --> 00:21:27.800
All right, then from now on,
 you have the privilege of being the new kid.

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:31.180
Just don't get in our way.

00:21:31.740 --> 00:21:33.390
I'll do my best, Shane, Tao.

00:21:33.640 --> 00:21:34.640
And Reina...

00:21:34.950 --> 00:21:35.890
Thank you.

00:21:36.570 --> 00:21:38.940
Okay then, off we go!

00:21:38.940 --> 00:21:42.130
Yeah! It's the new Tao family's first adventure!

00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:45.910
I never said you could call us 
the Tao family! Do you hear me?

00:21:46.630 --> 00:21:50.230
There they go again...

00:21:51.270 --> 00:21:53.740
What are you doing, new kid?

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:55.340
Er, sorry!

00:22:01.330 --> 00:22:05.450
<i>When I was born, I wasn't assigned a fate.</i>

00:22:06.150 --> 00:22:08.300
<i>I thought that was normal.</i>

00:22:10.430 --> 00:22:14.680
<i>But when I met Reina and
 the others, I realized...</i>

00:22:16.130 --> 00:22:22.400
<i>I'd yet to pick one for myself.</i>

00:22:27.320 --> 00:22:30.380
<i>That's why I left on a journey with them...</i>

00:22:31.170 --> 00:22:35.690
<i>And how my once-unwritten story began.</i>
